    "CVE-2023-54404": "GHSA-mrhx-c7xc-m3w5, zod <4.6.6 memory exhaustion when an unbounded array schema parses an attacker-supplied oversized array. The 4.x copies are overridden to 4.6.7; no 3.x release is fixed. Its three 3.23.8 dependents never parse untrusted input with it: apps/web imports zod only in one unit test (shape-editor-roundtrip), apps/admin does not import it, and prisma-kysely is a vestigial prisma generator nothing in apps/api imports. Remove when web/admin move to zod 4 (and prisma-kysely is dropped)."
  },
